<title>GERMANY: Spanish Aviaco adds Frankfurt-Jerez flights.</title>
<headline>Spanish Aviaco adds Frankfurt-Jerez flights.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish airline Aviaco said it will fly three times a week from Frankfurt to Jerez de la Frontera in Andalusia from April 1.</p>
<p>Aviaco, part of the Iberia group, said it has added a new destination in Spain following a 10 percent increase in passenger numbers last year on its Frankfurt to Zaragoza service.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
